@startuml
title A-COP A2A Remote Team delegation lifecycle
skinparam backgroundColor #faf9ff
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #7c3aed
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #f5f3ff
  ParticipantBorderColor #7c3aed
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ede9fe
  ArrowColor #4b5563
}

actor "외부 기업 Agent 플랫폼" as Client
participant "A-COP Agent Gateway" as Gateway
participant "TeamRegistry" as Registry
participant "TeamExecutorPort" as Port
participant "A2A Remote Team\n(Catalog & Verification)" as Remote
participant "Controller" as Controller

note over Client,Gateway
외부 기업 Agent 플랫폼이 A-COP에 업무를 위임한다.
개인 AI의 MCP 도구 호출이나 일반 Case 흐름은 이 그림의 범위가 아니다.
end note

Client -> Gateway: Agent Card 조회
Gateway --> Client: Agent Card\ncapability / schema / auth / task mode
Client -> Gateway: A2A Task 생성\ncase_id, capability=sku_verify, deadline_s, idempotency_key
Gateway -> Gateway: scope·audience·인증·idempotency 검증
Gateway -> Controller: 외부 위임 Task 전달
Controller -> Registry: capability resolve
Registry --> Controller: execution_type=A2A\nagent_card_url / a2a_endpoint
Controller -> Port: execute(TeamTask)
Port -> Remote: Task 요청
Remote --> Port: status=working
Port --> Controller: TeamResult(outcome=waiting)\n원격 task 추적 시작
Controller -> Gateway: Case running 반영
Gateway --> Client: task_id / status=working

loop 상태 폴링 또는 콜백
  Client -> Gateway: Task 상태 조회 또는 callback
  Gateway -> Remote: 원격 상태 조회
  Remote --> Gateway: working / progress
  Gateway --> Client: 상태·progress
end

alt 추가 입력 필요 (input-required)
  Remote --> Port: required package_unit / reason
  Port -> Controller: need_more_context 정규화
  Controller -> Controller: Case waiting_external
  Controller --> Gateway: 질문 / resume token
  Gateway --> Client: 추가 입력 요청
  Client -> Gateway: 추가 입력
  Gateway -> Port: resume(task_id, input)
  Port -> Remote: A2A Task resume
  Remote --> Port: status=working
  Port --> Controller: Case running 재개
else 완료
  Remote --> Port: status=completed\nArtifact: verification_report + evidence_manifest
  Port -> Controller: Artifact 근거 대조
end

Port -> Port: A2A Adapter 결과를 canonical TeamResult로 정규화
note right of Port
LOCAL 실행도 동일한 TeamExecutorPort 뒤에서
canonical TeamResult로 정규화된다.
Controller는 LOCAL/A2A 차이를 보지 않는다.
end note
Port --> Controller: TeamResult(outcome=completed)\nArtifact digest / evidence
Controller -> Gateway: Case resolved 또는 후속 판단
Gateway --> Client: TeamResult + Artifact 반환

note over Gateway,Remote
보안 원칙 적용:
scope와 audience·만료·발급자 검증,
case_id + idempotency key로 중복 Task 방지,
Task·상태·Artifact·실패를 audit 기록.
token 원문은 로그에 남기지 않는다.
end note

note right of Controller
A2A Task ↔ A-COP Case 상태 매핑
working → running
input-required → waiting_input
completed → resolved 또는 후속 판단
failed → escalated
cancelled → cancelled
timeout / 조회 불명 → escalated + remote unknown
end note

alt 실패·timeout·인증 실패
  Remote --> Port: 5xx / timeout / auth failure
  Port -> Port: 제한적 재시도 후 deadline 판정
  Port --> Controller: remote outcome=unknown
  Controller -> Gateway: Case escalated
  Gateway --> Client: 오류 근거·task_id·unknown 반환
else 취소
  Client -> Gateway: 취소 요청
  Gateway -> Port: cancel(task_id)
  Port -> Remote: A2A cancel
  Remote --> Port: cancelled 확인
  Port --> Controller: TeamResult(outcome=cancelled)
  Controller -> Gateway: Case cancelled
  Gateway --> Client: 취소 결과 반환
end
@enduml
